0 // Separate 4 x 4 stud stone plinth with a nominal 20 x 20 LDU shaft and a same-height 2 x 2 minifigure standing pad immediately south; a lower 2 x 4 plate ties the pad to the plinth. Rapier 93550 blade section is about 4.25 LDU; its 20 LDU guard stays at the opening lip, the tip enters 78 LDU, and a 78 LDU vertical lift clears it. Geometry has no rock/sword crossing; real retention and clutch remain unverified.
